{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"daniel-kahneman","categoryLabel":"丹尼尔·卡尼曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/07_daniel-kahneman/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代表成就\">代表成就</h1><p>本卷聚焦丹尼尔·卡尼曼（1934–2024）的<strong>代表性成就载体</strong>——那些把他的思想固化、传播、并被世界承认的具体产物：一部畅销巨著、一座诺贝尔奖、一系列里程碑论文，以及晚年的《噪声》。这里回答的是&quot;卡尼曼留下了哪些可指认的作品与荣誉&quot;，而非这些作品里的思想本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>为避免重复，本卷与同一人物的其他卷边界清晰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1_生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、如何与特沃斯基合作</td>\n<td>提供作品的人物背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2_核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>启发法、前景理论、双系统<strong>是什么</strong></td>\n<td>本卷作品的思想内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3_思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>如何思考</strong>判断与体验</td>\n<td>作品背后的方法论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4_代表成就（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>有哪些<strong>作品与荣誉</strong></td>\n<td>思想的产物与载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5_影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>作品<strong>影响了谁</strong></td>\n<td>本卷成果的下游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6_争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>作品的<strong>可靠性与批评</strong></td>\n<td>对本卷成果的审视</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>本卷是&quot;作品清单&quot;，思想细节去 2/3 卷，影响与批评去 5/6 卷。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构\">三章结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[第1章&lt;br/&gt;思考快与慢&lt;br/&gt;大众巨著]&#10;    B[第2章&lt;br/&gt;诺贝尔奖&lt;br/&gt;学界承认]&#10;    C[第3章&lt;br/&gt;研究的成就&lt;br/&gt;论文与噪声]&#10;    B --&gt; A&#10;    C --&gt; B&#10;    C --&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[第1章&lt;br/&gt;思考快与慢&lt;br/&gt;大众巨著]\n    B[第2章&lt;br/&gt;诺贝尔奖&lt;br/&gt;学界承认]\n    C[第3章&lt;br/&gt;研究的成就&lt;br/&gt;论文与噪声]\n    B --&gt; A\n    C --&gt; B\n    C --&gt; A</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章·思考，快与慢</strong>：2011 年的畅销巨著（<a href=\"thinking-fast-and-slow/the-book\">成书与影响</a>、<a href=\"thinking-fast-and-slow/key-ideas\">核心概念</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章·诺贝尔奖</strong>：2002 年获奖（<a href=\"the-nobel-prize/winning-the-nobel\">荣获诺奖</a>、<a href=\"the-nobel-prize/founding-behavioral-economics\">行为经济学的奠基</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章·研究的成就</strong>：奠基论文与晚年新作（<a href=\"research-legacy/landmark-papers\">里程碑论文</a>、<a href=\"research-legacy/noise-and-later-work\">噪声与晚年研究</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>按&quot;时间倒序的可读性&quot;推荐：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>若你完全不了解卡尼曼</strong>：先读 <a href=\"thinking-fast-and-slow/key-ideas\">1_思考，快与慢·核心概念</a>，它是最易懂的入口。</li>\n<li><strong>想理解其学术地位</strong>：再读 <a href=\"the-nobel-prize/winning-the-nobel\">2_诺贝尔奖</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>想追溯思想源头</strong>：最后读 <a href=\"research-legacy/landmark-papers\">3_里程碑论文</a> 与 <a href=\"research-legacy/noise-and-later-work\">噪声</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置建议</strong>：理解本卷无需经济学背景，但若想深究概念，建议配合阅读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/prospect-theory/\">2_核心贡献·前景理论</a>。这些代表成就，共同确立了卡尼曼作为行为经济学奠基人的历史地位。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thinking-fast-and-slow","title":"思考，快与慢","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/thinking-fast-and-slow","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-book","title":"《思考，快与慢》：成书与影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/thinking-fast-and-slow/the-book"},{"seq":2,"slug":"key-ideas","title":"《思考，快与慢》：核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/thinking-fast-and-slow/key-ideas"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-nobel-prize","title":"诺贝尔奖","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/the-nobel-prize","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"winning-the-nobel","title":"荣获 2002 年诺贝尔经济学奖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/the-nobel-prize/winning-the-nobel"},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-behavioral-economics","title":"行为经济学的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/the-nobel-prize/founding-behavioral-economics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"research-legacy","title":"研究的成就","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/research-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"landmark-papers","title":"里程碑式的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/research-legacy/landmark-papers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"noise-and-later-work","title":"《噪声》与晚年研究","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/daniel-kahneman/major-works/research-legacy/noise-and-later-work"}]}]}